<h2 id="faq">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">How does Jasper's brand voice work?<span>+</span></div><div class="faq-answer">Brand Voice learns your unique tone, style, and messaging by analyzing your existing content. Upload examples of your best work, and Jasper's AI creates a custom model that matches your brand's voice. You can create multiple brand voices for different products, audiences, or clients.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">What is Boss Mode and do I need it?<span>+</span></div><div class="faq-answer">Boss Mode (included in all plans) gives you advanced control over Jasper's AI. You can write commands to tell Jasper exactly what to do, edit and expand content, and work more efficiently with keyboard shortcuts. It's essential for long-form content creation and is now included in all plans.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">Can Jasper help with SEO?<span>+</span></div><div class="faq-answer">Yes, Jasper integrates with Surfer SEO to provide real-time SEO scoring and optimization suggestions. However, Surfer SEO requires a separate subscription. The integration helps you create content that ranks by suggesting keywords, optimal content length, and structure while you write.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">How is Jasper Chat different from ChatGPT?<span>+</span></div><div class="faq-answer">Jasper Chat is built specifically for marketing and content creation with your brand voice integrated. It remembers context from your conversation, can access recent information, and generates content in your brand's tone. Unlike ChatGPT, it's designed for professional content creation with better output consistency.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">Is there a word limit on Jasper?<span>+</span></div><div class="faq-answer">Jasper uses a credit system where each plan includes a certain number of words per month. Creator gets around 50K words, Pro gets 100K words. You can purchase additional words if needed. Business plans can be customized for unlimited words based on your needs.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">Can I use Jasper content commercially?<span>+</span></div><div class="faq-answer">Yes, you own all rights to content generated with Jasper and can use it for any commercial purpose including client work, marketing materials, products, and publications. Always review and edit AI-generated content to ensure accuracy and originality before publishing.</div></div>
